         pod):                                                                  
         ```bash                                                                
         kubectl run --rm -i --restart=Never curlpod                            
         --image=radial/busyboxplus:curl --command -- curl -sS --connect-timeout
         5 http://app-service:8000/ || true                                     
         ```                                                                    
                                                                                
